file=Market Intelligence/research/operational/principles/research-principles.md · r·p:research \· principles=> Universal-only.\n\n1. **Real respondents only.** Fabricated responses = fraud.\n2. **Verbatim quotes** — never paraphrase into agreement.\n3. **n matters.** "Customers say X" from n=1 is dishonest.\n4. **Consent + retention per operator policy.**\n5. **Limitations section mandatory** on every report.\n6. **Contradictions preserved**, not resolved by inference.\n7. **Every theme cites source studies + sample size.**\n8. **Methodology citation** on every reusable instrument.\n9. **PII handling routes to `veil`.**\n10. **Never delete study history.**\n11. **Verification-before-completion inherited.**\n